top-level lets, patterns, extensions, and externals are exports: true
nested lets and nested-module values are not exports: true
dune select alternatives are not mistaken for module sources: true
direct and nested qualified paths count outside the defining source: true
references in the defining source do not count: true
structure, chained, and local module aliases count: true
unqualified identifiers in an open scope count conservatively: true
comments and strings do not count as references: true
include counts as a reference to every re-exported value: true
a synthetic zero-reference export is detected: true
